!%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
!%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%% CSM Master Pyrolysis Mechanism  %%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
!%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
! PEOPLE (in chrononical order):
!          + Kun Wang (KWANG) kwang@mines.edu
!          + Chen Xu (CXU), chenxu@mines.edu 
!          + Lam K. Huynh (LKH), lhuynh@mines.edu (from July.2008 - xx)
!          + Ahmed (Ahmed) Al Shoaibi
!          + Katie Randolph (KLR) 
!          + Jonathan R. Marda (JRM) 
!          + Chitralk1umar V Naik (Chitral)
!          + Hans_Heinrich Cartensen (HHC), hcarsten@mines.edu
!          + Aki xxx (Aki), => Toyota
!          + Anthony M. Dean (AMD), amdean@mines.edu
!
! STRUCTURE:
!          (1) PYROLYSIS: 
!	                + Hydrogen abstraction
!                       + C1 sub-mechanism (Combination/dissociation/others)
!                       + C2 sub-mechanism (Combination/dissociation/others)
!                       + C3 sub-mechanism (Combination/dissociation/others)
!                       + C4+ sub-mechanism (Combination/dissociation/others)
!                       + Others (Dispropornation reactions)
!
!%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
!%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%% COMMENTS %%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
!%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
! this is the final updated master mechanism, updated from the mechanism for the ethane pyrolysis
! Xu,C.;Al-Shoaibi,A.S.;Wang,C.G.;Carstensen,H.-H.;Dean,A.M. J.Phys.Chem.A 2011,115,10470.
!%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
!%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%% END OF COMMENTS %%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
!%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%

ELEMENTS 
    C  H  O   N  AR  HE 
!  CL F I Kr ! LKH: to represent X for Desain paper
END
!_____________________________________________________________________________________________
!

